       wwiirree‐‐tteesstt is used to find out what amd thinks are the first two network
       interfaces  and  network  names/numbers used, as well as the IP address
       used for amd to NFS‐mount itself.

       If _h_o_s_t is specified, then wwiirree‐‐tteesstt will test for the working combina‐
       tions of NFS protocol and version from the current client  to  the  NFS
       server _h_o_s_t_.  If not specified, _h_o_s_t defaults to "localhost".


